# The Puppet Master (battlefield.puppet_master): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Earth_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). EP_Entrance with the clearance and the pendulum kept: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/Earth_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster accepted
charvar Quest[2][81]Prog 1
item EarthPendulum
login
trade EP_Entrance EarthPendulum x1      # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, area 1: entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -538.4,0.455,-493.9 CloisterOfTremors
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the clearance, the pendulum kept: the default
